    kind: work_item  # ba4a
    title: "WI-kafar CI validator gate scope: --frameworks all (33 violations) and --include-docs (4321 violations, 130× larger) writer paths escape the default-substrate gate"  # ba4a
    status: todo_hard  # ba4a
    priority: 1  # ba4a
    parent: INV-luhur-sital-lonar-tagiv-kuzab-mokol-jikot-fosug  # ba4a
